  <h2>Gilimanuk to Ubud: How Long Does It Take?</h2>

  <p>Gilimanuk to Ubud is approximately 130 km by road. The most direct route follows the Denpasar–Gilimanuk highway east before turning inland.</p>

  <p>By private car, expect 3.5–4.5 hours depending on traffic. Ubud traffic — particularly in and around central Ubud — can add 30–60 minutes during peak hours (morning drop-offs and evening rush from 5–8 pm).</p>

  <p>For a detailed breakdown of the route, read our full guide: <a href="/blog/how-to-get-from-gilimanuk-to-ubud/">How to Get from Gilimanuk to Ubud</a>.</p>

